# Witness: a wrong suite total in each recognised phrasing

One sentence per recognised phrasing, each carrying its own number, and no sentence is matched
by more than one of them - so deleting any entry from the phrasing list drops exactly one
violation and this assertion fails. The first is the phrasing HUMAN_REVIEW.md section 5, both
bundle READMEs and the status ledger actually use, and it carried no witness at all.

- The suite reports 901 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped.

- The suite records 902 passing tests.

- The run shows 903 tests passed with no failures.

- The run reported 904 tests, 0 failures, 0 skips.
